   "fix": "Replace `variable {K : Type*} [Field K] [NumberField K]` with `variable {K : Type*} [Field K] [CharZero K]`; the proof `rw [minpoly.isIntegrallyClosed_eq_field_fractions' \u211a x.isIntegral_coe, minpoly_coe]` is unchanged.",
